{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/101618","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/101618/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/101618/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/101618/events","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/101618","id":2791390905,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc6H72ji","number":101618,"title":"VariantParser: Fix reading negated identifiers, replace `inf_neg` with `-inf`","user":{"login":"aaronfranke","id":1646875,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2NDY4NzU=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1646875?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronfranke","html_url":"https://github.com/aaronfranke","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronfranke/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronfranke/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronfranke/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronfranke/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronfranke/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronfranke/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronfranke/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronfranke/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronfranke/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","color":"ff6055","default":true,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","color":"aaccff","default":true,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279097966,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTc5NjY=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:core","name":"topic:core","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/22","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/22","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/22/labels","id":12070367,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AuC3f","number":22,"title":"4.5","description":"","creator":{"login":"Sauermann","id":6299227,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYyOTkyMjc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6299227?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann","html_url":"https://github.com/Sauermann","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":3,"closed_issues":3687,"state":"closed","created_at":"2024-12-19T08:51:28Z","updated_at":"2026-09-04T21:48:38Z","due_on":"2025-09-15T00:00:00Z","closed_at":"2025-09-18T17:13:14Z"},"comments":2,"created_at":"2025-01-16T00:59:01Z","updated_at":"2025-04-03T21:32:25Z","closed_at":"2025-03-07T18:11:01Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"MEMBER","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/101618","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/101618","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/101618.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/101618.patch","merged_at":"2025-03-07T18:11:01Z"},"body":"This PR is a subset of PR #100414 that fixes VariantParser to allow for reading negative identifiers in `.tscn` files, and also changes the serialization of negative infinity from `inf_neg` to just `-inf`. In the current master, the code assumes that anything starting with `-` is a finite number.\r\n\r\nTo test this PR, I made a new project with a Node3D and gave it a tool script like this:\r\n\r\n```gdscript\r\n@tool\r\nextends Node3D\r\n\r\nfunc _ready():\r\n\tprint(position) # Prints (0.0, 0.0, 0.0) the first time, then (inf, -inf, nan) after the scene is saved and re-opened.\r\n\tposition.x = INF\r\n\tposition.y = -INF\r\n\tposition.z = NAN\r\n```\r\n\r\nNote: The reason I previously did not have this change separated out is because I wanted to go straight from `inf_neg` to `-INF` instead of going through `-inf` first, but it seems PR #100414 was a bit too much to review in one go.\r\n\r\nNote: We should also [cherry-pick most of these changes to older Godot versions](https://github.com/aaronfranke/godot/tree/4.3-var-parser-neg-ident), except for the `inf_neg` writing change, so that older versions can read new files saved with `-inf`, but the old versions should keep writing `inf_neg` to match older patch releases in those minor versions. However, this is not vital since `-inf` is a very rare value to serialize to a `.tscn` file, especially because it is currently not possible to read or write such values in the editor inspector.","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/101618/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":1,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/101618/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}